                            {
                                "box": {
                                    "fontname": "Arial",
                                    "fontsize": 12.0,
                                    "id": "notes",
                                    "linecount": 5,
                                    "maxclass": "comment",
                                    "numinlets": 1,
                                    "numoutlets": 0,
                                    "patching_rect": [ 35.0, 660.0, 1080.0, 115.0 ],
                                    "text": "Preset 1 starts with the sound in the supplied patch. Slots 2–128 start empty. STORE on an occupied number replaces only that number.\nThe embedded code saves every occupied slot in this .maxpat; no separate script or preset-bank file is needed. Reopening recalls the last stored or recalled slot.\nMONITOR remains independent and opens in Room (2). Both live.gain~ levels, DSP power, recording and playback remain independent of presets.\nThe binaural stage still renders the actual eight multichannel outputs. Speaker geometry is regenerated from oper on recall. Custom HRTF files must remain available to SPAT.\nThis bank restores acoustic parameters, not oper window placement or internal snapshot banks."
                                }
                            },
