                                    "patching_rect": [ 20.0, 585.0, 1100.0, 47.0 ],
                                    "text": "0 = Off | 1 = Headphones on DAC 1-2 | 2 = Room on DAC 1-8.\nSelectors are mutually exclusive even when DSP is stopped. With DSP running, a common fade masks route changes.\nChannels 3-8 are silent in Headphones mode. Both recordings are taken before this monitor selector.",
